        "Frontend reviewed-reply consumer and real-provider delivery remain unqualified. Evidence/API contract: artifacts/acceptance/TC-18-001 and docs/release/tickets/TC-18-001.md. Only the lease-holding coordinator publishes and merges. Related #85."
